#: ../../source/docs/rover-features.rst:6 c52feb736c3f453dae539caafd48d7f2
msgid "Rover Operational Features"
msgstr "Rover 操作功能"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-features.rst:8 85b4f9cce805405b8168ed4f828f4dd2
msgid ""
"Rover has a lot of different vehicle types, and advanced features which can "
"be accessed either via configuration parameters or via mission commands. "
"Supported vehicle types include :ref:`Boats <boat-configuration>`, "
":ref:`Sailboats <sailboat-home>`, :ref:`Balance Bots <balance_bot-home>`, "
"and :ref:`Walking Robots <walking-robots>`. For a full set of features see "
"the :ref:`common-advanced-configuration` page, the :doc:`full parameter list"
" <parameters>`, and the `MAVLink protocol definition "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/>`__."
msgstr ""
"Rover 拥有多种车辆类型和高级功能，可通过配置参数或任务指令访问。支持的车辆类型包括 :ref:`船 <boat-"
"configuration>`、:ref:`帆船 <sailboat-home>`、:ref:`平衡机器人 <balance_bot-home>` 和 "
":ref:`步行机器人 <walking-robots>`。完整功能集请参见 :ref:`common-advanced-configuration` "
"页面、:doc:`完整参数列表 <parameters>` 以及 `MAVLink 协议定义 <https://mavlink.io/en/>`__。"
